BANANA_SHORT_MENU: the main menu with only what a player of the RG DS's Game & Watch uses (the F button opens it):
Video Options (the artwork's views), Machine Configuration and DIP Switches (where a game has them), Input
Settings, Audio Mixer, Close Menu, and MAME's own Quit (left out of its menu upstream).

